      "title": "ICICIBANK: Future GST Dispute Resolutions Will Support Bullish Case",
      "body": "ICICI Bank's analyst price target has shifted from about ₹1,703 to about ₹1,664, with analysts pointing to slightly lower fair value and future P/E assumptions, alongside largely unchanged discount rate, revenue growth and profit margin inputs. What's in the News ICICI Bank received an order under Section 74 of the Maharashtra GST Act for a GST demand of ₹3,843,353,972, with an equivalent amount of penalty and applicable interest related to services provided to customers maintaining specified minimum balances.",
