      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹17.54 (down from ₹18.26 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹522.6b (up 3.0% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹125.4b (down 2.7% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 24% (down from 25% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Revenue is expected to decline by 3.5% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, while revenues in the Banks industry in India are expected to grow by 1.5%. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 16% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 17% per year.",
