      "body": "Analysts have nudged their fair value estimate for ICICI Bank to ₹1,700 from about ₹1,683, tying this to updated assumptions that include a slightly lower discount rate, a smaller projected revenue decline, and a broadly similar profit margin and future P/E profile. What's in the News ICICI Bank received a GST order from the West Bengal Goods and Services Tax authority under Section 73 of the West Bengal GST Act, 2017, raising a demand of ₹160,330,178, including tax of ₹86,757,468, interest of ₹64,896,963 and penalty of ₹8,675,747, which the bank plans to contest through an appeal within the prescribed timelines (company disclosure).",
